            "id": 87047,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Создай глобальную переменную <code>discount</code>, затем отобрази её вне цикла.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"price = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"discount = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  price = price - discount\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Discount: \" /><text value=\"{discount}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Price: \" /><text value=\"{price}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"103\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Discount: 10\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Price: 80\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>discount = 10</code>, а затем <code>print(f\"Discount: {discount}\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Цикл <code>for</code> не является функцией, поэтому <code>discount</code> остается глобальной переменной.</p><p>Задай ей значение <code>10</code>, затем отобрази ее после цикла, чтобы вывести <code>Discount: 10</code> и <code>Price: 80</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"price = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"discount = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" range(\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  price = price - discount\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Discount: \" /><text value=\"{discount}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Price: \" /><text value=\"{price}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"discount = 20\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print(discount)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Discount: 10\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Price: 80\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>discount = 10</code>, а затем <code>print(f\"Discount: {discount}\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
